INSERT IGNORE INTO `company_reviews` (`id`, `company_id`, `rating`, `content`, `createdAt`, `updatedAt`) VALUES
(1, 7, 5, 'I had an absolutely wonderful experience during the KMD recruitment process. From the moment I submitted my application, the recruitment team was incredibly responsive and communicative. The interviews felt less like an interrogation and more like a supportive, two-way conversation about my career goals. They provided great insights into the team culture, and the technical evaluation was highly relevant to the actual role. Getting hired here felt transparent and fair, and the onboarding was top-notch!', '2026-08-05 10:55:00', '2026-08-05 10:55:00'),
(2, 8, 5, 'TalentBridge Hub completely streamlined our hiring process. We posted a role and had qualified applicants within days — the platform is intuitive, and managing our job posts and candidates has never been easier. Highly recommend for any company looking to hire faster and smarter.', '2026-08-07 04:48:28', '2026-08-07 04:48:28'),
(3, 10, 4, 'Overall a strong experience using TalentBridge Hub to fill our open roles. The platform made it easy to post positions and manage applicants in one place, and we found solid candidates faster than through our usual channels. Would appreciate a few more advanced filtering options for reviewing applicants at scale, but the core hiring workflow has been reliable and efficient.', '2026-08-07 08:05:03', '2026-08-07 08:05:03'),
(4, 11, 5, 'have been using this recruitment platform for the past three months, and it has completely exceeded my expectations in every possible way. The user interface is exceptionally clean, intuitive, and highly responsive on both desktop and mobile iOS browsers. What sets this website apart from other job boards is its highly sophisticated filtering system, which allows candidates to narrow down positions by precise location, salary range, specific skill sets, and remote work flexibility. The automated email alerts are incredibly reliable and match my career goals perfectly without spamming my inbox. Uploading multiple versions of my resume and cover letter was seamless, and the internal dashboard makes tracking application statuses very straightforward. This is truly a top-tier system that bridges the gap between hiring managers and qualified candidates effectively. Five stars!', '2026-08-07 09:32:14', '2026-08-07 09:32:14');
